Package: mv-data
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: sparse data mover for disk image assembly
 Copies a range of bytes from an input file into an output file at a given
 offset, punching holes in the input as it goes so a filesystem image can be
 placed into a partition slot of a disk image without doubling storage use.
